== 3.7 Chapter 3 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Magnetic field lines outside a bar magnet run],
  [from the south pole to the north pole],
  [from the north pole to the south pole],
  [in circles round the magnet],
  [from both poles outwards to infinity]
)

